@indigo_nakamoto @inevitable360 @Bitcoin @litecoin @dogecoin A few thoughts 

1. Dogecoin subsidy approaches 0 as a percentage of total supply (it remains 10k coins / block) while BTC and ltc approach 0 literally. 

2. To lean on tx fees you need to scale on L1, making L2s a potential threat, especially with diminishing subsidies models.
